cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mirobody-gen in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "mirobody-gen: knowledge-driven synthetic health records rendered as documents"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-29
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody-gen"
authors:
  - name: "Theta AI Team"
    email: developer@thetahealth.ai
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - health records
  - laboratory reports
  - document parsing
  - OCR robustness
  - privacy
abstract: >
  A generator of synthetic longitudinal health records rendered as the documents people upload
  (laboratory slips, check-up books, clinic notes, home logs) across text, scan, photo, copy and
  screen tiers, with row-level ground truth for extraction and standardisation. Values are computed
  from public reference standards and a mechanistic model; no real record is on the generation path.
